F_pressure = -m * (P_i + P_j) / (2 * ρ_j) * ∇W_ij

Where ∇W_ij (spiky gradient) = spikyGrad * (h - r)^2 in the direction of r_ij

So the complete formula is:
F_pressure = -dir * mass * (pi->pressure + pj->pressure) / (2 * pj->density) * spikyGrad * (h - dist)^2

